Download Now Wendy’s & DUNKIN’ Georgia mobile app! Place order, get lots of rewards and special offers!

From this app you can easily:

    • Place order ahead at preferred restaurant, while you are on the way and get your meal without standing in line. You can even schedule the order pickup time;
    • Get reward points on every purchase you made through this app at every Wendy’s & DUNKIN’ restaurant;
    • Exchange your reward points to various products which you can find in Wendy's & DUNKIN' gifts store;
    • Check-in daily and get different special offers tailored for you;
    • Add your best pick products under “Favorite” tab and order easily;

Enjoy hole new experience with Wendy’s & DUNKIN’ Georgia loyalty app and please do share your feedback. 

Note: Reward scheme is common for both brands. You can earn and exchange points from one another.

Pic2Recipe: Transforming Ingredients into Culinary Wonders

Pic2Recipe is an innovative iOS app that takes the art of cooking to a new level. Say goodbye to traditional recipe books and cooking apps. We introduce the most intuitive and practical mobile app for converting your ingredient photos into delightful recipes. If you're uncertain about what to cook with your available ingredients, Pic2Recipe is your smart, simple solution.

PERFECT INGREDIENT RECOGNITION

• Utilize state-of-the-art AI to identify ingredients in your photos;
• Instantly turn recognized ingredients into creative recipe ideas;
• Highlight essential ingredients and suggest complementary additions;
• Promote sustainable cooking by minimizing food waste.

AI-POWERED RECIPE GENERATION

• Craft personalized recipes effortlessly;
• Adapt recipes to dietary needs and preferences;
• Provide easy-to-follow, step-by-step cooking instructions;
• Explore a diverse range of unique, AI-generated recipes.

CUSTOMIZE YOUR CULINARY JOURNEY

• Tailor recipe complexity and prep time to fit your lifestyle;
• Filter recipes by cuisine, dietary requirements, or specific ingredients;
• Personalize recipes by adjusting ingredient quantities and alternatives;
• Share and discover culinary creations within a vibrant community.

EXTRA PERKS

• Rely on Auto Recipe Generation for quick meal ideas;
• Bookmark favorite recipes and ingredients for easy access;
• Get inspired by daily recipe recommendations tailored to your preferences;
• Experience a sleek, user-friendly interface, optimized for iOS.
